# Build context = repo root (BuildKit picks this sidecar up for
# apps/daemon/docker/Dockerfile). Installs and build outputs stay out —
# the image builds everything from source; .git stays IN so the build
# stamps ohd --version with the real commit.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-*
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
docs
